Subject: [PATCH 10/12] tools/mate-bots.sh: install the verdict dances, seed
 their music volume
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

start (and the new "dances" command on its own) copies the verdict dance
titles in DANCES (default: the server's JUDGE_DANCE_WIN, _LOSE and _DRAW
or their defaults "MMD-Conqueror", "MMD-Lost One_s Weeping" and
"MMD-皆大欢喜-卜逻desu") from DANCE_LIBRARY, searched with its
subfolders and matched in any case like FindIndexByTitle, into the
build's StreamingAssets/CustomDances/. A file already there with the
same bytes is left alone, so a restart is cheap and a rebuild that drops
them is repaired by the next start; a missing title is named, not fatal.

speech_bridge.json gains danceMusicVolume from DANCE_VOLUME (default
0.4): the winner's music. The pet/effects/menu volumes stay at 0; none of
them is the dance player's.
